---
title: Bond Create Wizard Flow
---
%%{init: {"fontSize": 18, "theme": "dark", "themeVariables": {"primaryColor": "#1e2030", "primaryTextColor": "#ffffff", "primaryBorderColor": "#5e6ad2", "lineColor": "#a0a8d0", "secondaryColor": "#2a2d3e", "tertiaryColor": "#131421"}, "flowchart": {"diagramPadding": 30, "nodeSpacing": 50, "rankSpacing": 60}}}%%
flowchart TD
    START([bond create]) --> ID

    ID["Bond identity\ntitle\ndescription"]

    ID --> TGT

    TGT["Goal type for this term?\nquantitative | qualitative | hybrid"]

    TGT -->|quantitative / hybrid| QC
    TGT -->|qualitative| CRIT

    QC["Enter quantitative fields\ndata_id, operator, threshold\naggregation optional"]
    QC --> CRIT

    CRIT["Enter criterion text\nhuman-readable description\nof the condition"]

    CRIT --> MORE

    MORE{Add another term?}

    MORE -->|Yes| TGT
    MORE -->|No, one term| TM
    MORE -->|No, multiple terms| AGG

    AGG["Aggregation across terms\nAND: all terms must be met\nOR: any term must be met"]

    AGG --> TM

    TM["Set timing\ndeadline YYYY-MM-DD\nexpiry YYYY-MM-DD\nmust be: expiry > deadline\ngrace_days: days after expiry\nbefore timelock matures"]

    TM --> COL

    COL["Set collateral\ncurrency: XMR | ZEC | BTC | ETH\namount per file\nnumber of files in series\nredemption_value optional"]

    COL --> ORC

    ORC["Configure oracle panel\nfor each oracle:\n  pubkey hex 32-byte\n  role: quantitative | qualitative | both\n  fee per attestation"]

    ORC --> QUO

    QUO["Set quorum and challenge\nminimum signatures to settle\nchallenge period in days"]

    QUO --> DIR

    DIR["Output directory\ndefault: current dir"]

    DIR --> PRV

    PRV{"Preview and confirm?\nshows terms list with AND/OR\ntotal collateral locked\noracle panel summary"}

    PRV -->|Cancel| CANCEL([Cancelled])
    PRV -->|Confirm| WRITE

    WRITE["Write .bond SQLite files\none file per unit serial\nfilename: seriesid-NNNN.bond\nPhase 1 TODO: nyxforge-bond crate"]

    WRITE --> DONE([Files written\nbond state: DRAFT])
